      "content": "i already tried talking to them and it was just a bunch of scripted responses. they weren't actually helping, it felt like they were just stallin for time. if they're trying to push me out, what kind of stuff should i be doing to protect myself? like, are there ways to move my money or manage my accounts so they cant keep messing with my transactions or draining me through these little fees?",
